  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p001:m0000" ref="wow_07g_swu">毛脩之</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p001:m0005" ref="wow_07g_swu">敬文</persName>，滎陽陽武人也。父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p001:m0016" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AB">瑾</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p001:m0018" ref="s6y_280_81r">司馬德宗</persName>梁秦二州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p002:m0000" ref="wow_07g_swu">脩之</persName>在南有四子，唯子<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-043-maoxiu-faren:p002:m0010" ref="wow_07g_swu_B">法仁</persName>入國。</p>
